{"id":"2b47c28942191578","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-use-principle.md","title":"有限预言机使用原理","display":"thm-use-principle — 有限预言机使用原理","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-use-principle","aliases":["43-thm-use-principle"],"display":"thm-use-principle — 有限预言机使用原理","depends_on":["[[43-df-oracle-computation]]","[[43-df-infseq]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28","source_location":"Lemma 5.4.1, print p.14 / PDF p.34","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"formalization-reviewed","source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-use-principle"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-use-principle</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-use-principle — 有限预言机使用原理"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4400f4836786a4bd\" href=\"?note=4400f4836786a4bd\" title=\"43-df-oracle-computation\">43-df-oracle-computation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"565c3258eee2a5ff\" href=\"?note=565c3258eee2a5ff\" title=\"43-df-infseq\">43-df-infseq</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Lemma 5.4.1, print p.14 / PDF p.34"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"formalization-reviewed"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathcal O\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathcal O\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e,x,y,m\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(e,x,y,m\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi_e^A(x)\\downarrow=y\">\\(\\Phi_e^A(x)\\downarrow=y\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u_e^A(x)=m\">\\(u_e^A(x)=m\\)</span>。计算、使用量及共同oracle域采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4400f4836786a4bd\" href=\"?note=4400f4836786a4bd\" title=\"43-df-oracle-computation\">43-df-oracle-computation</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{AsSequence}\">\\(\\operatorname{AsSequence}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"565c3258eee2a5ff\" href=\"?note=565c3258eee2a5ff\" title=\"43-df-infseq\">43-df-infseq</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{AsSequence}(A)\\upharpoonright m=\\operatorname{AsSequence}(B)\\upharpoonright m\\Rightarrow\\Phi_e^B(x)\\downarrow=y.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{AsSequence}(A)\\upharpoonright m=\\operatorname{AsSequence}(B)\\upharpoonright m\\Rightarrow\\Phi_e^B(x)\\downarrow=y.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>计算在A上已经停机，因此m为唯一有限使用量。前m位回答相同，确定性逐步保证两次运行相同。</p>\n<p>来源定位沿用附件：Lemma 5.4.1, print p.14 / PDF p.34。本轮核查形式化的内部一致性；未重新核对原书完整证明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-oracle-computation","status":"resolved","id":"4400f4836786a4bd","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-oracle-computation]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-infseq","status":"resolved","id":"565c3258eee2a5ff","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-infseq]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-oracle-computation","status":"resolved","id":"4400f4836786a4bd","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A,B\\in\\mathcal O$，$e,x,y,m\\in\\mathbb N$；$\\Phi_e^A(x)\\downarrow=y$ 且 $u_e^A(x)=m$。计算、使用量及共同oracle域采用 [[43-df-oracle-computation]]；$\\operatorname{AsSequence}$ 采用 [[43-df-infseq]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-infseq","status":"resolved","id":"565c3258eee2a5ff","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A,B\\in\\mathcal O$，$e,x,y,m\\in\\mathbb N$；$\\Phi_e^A(x)\\downarrow=y$ 且 $u_e^A(x)=m$。计算、使用量及共同oracle域采用 [[43-df-oracle-computation]]；$\\operatorname{AsSequence}$ 采用 [[43-df-infseq]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"A,B\\in\\mathcal O","display":false},{"tex":"e,x,y,m\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\Phi_e^A(x)\\downarrow=y","display":false},{"tex":"u_e^A(x)=m","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{AsSequence}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{AsSequence}(A)\\upharpoonright m=\\operatorname{AsSequence}(B)\\upharpoonright m\\Rightarrow\\Phi_e^B(x)\\downarrow=y.","display":true}],"bytes":1189,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-82","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-thm-use-principle]] — 有限预言机使用原理"}],"outgoing":["4400f4836786a4bd","565c3258eee2a5ff"]}